  "ingredients": [
    "2 cup mozzarella cheese (shredded)",
    "1/2 teaspoon dried oregano",
    "1/2 teaspoon paprika",
    "1/2 teaspoon crushed red pepper flakes",
    "black pepper (to taste)",
    "3/4 cup almond flour",
    "1 tablespoon tomato paste (No sugar added)",
    "11 teaspoon cream cheese",
    "1/3 cup jalapeno pepper (chopped)",
    "4 slice cooked bacon (chopped)",
    "3 tablespoon fresh chives (chopped)",
    "1/2 teaspoon garlic powder"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 350F. In a microwave-safe bowl, place your mozzarella cheese. Add the oregano, paprika, red chili flakes, and pepper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/jalapeno-popper-pizza/#wprm-recipe-52575-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/keto-jalapeno-popper-pizza-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat the cheese up in the microwave, for approximately one minute, or until it has melted.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/jalapeno-popper-pizza/#wprm-recipe-52575-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/keto-jalapeno-popper-pizza-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir almond flour into the cheese, mixing until a dough forms.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/jalapeno-popper-pizza/#wprm-recipe-52575-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/keto-jalapeno-popper-pizza-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place your dough onto a piece of parchment paper on top of a pizza tray if you have one. It’s not mandatory, but provides stabilization when transferring to the oven.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/jalapeno-popper-pizza/#wprm-recipe-52575-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/keto-jalapeno-popper-pizza-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using your hands, knead the dough together while forming a circle.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/jalapeno-popper-pizza/#wprm-recipe-52575-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/keto-jalapeno-popper-pizza-06.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using a rolling pin, roll the dough into a larger circle shape.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/jalapeno-popper-pizza/#wprm-recipe-52575-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/keto-jalapeno-popper-pizza-07.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll the edges of the dough 2 inches towards the center of the pizza to form a crust.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/jalapeno-popper-pizza/#wprm-recipe-52575-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/keto-jalapeno-popper-pizza-08.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Put the tomato paste in the center of the dough, spreading it around with a spoon.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/jalapeno-popper-pizza/#wprm-recipe-52575-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/keto-jalapeno-popper-pizza-09.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using a teaspoon, place chunks of cream cheese all around the pizza.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/jalapeno-popper-pizza/#wprm-recipe-52575-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/keto-jalapeno-popper-pizza-11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top with jalapenos, bacon, chives and garlic powder.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/jalapeno-popper-pizza/#wprm-recipe-52575-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/keto-jalapeno-popper-pizza-14.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook for 30-40 minutes. Slice and serve.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/jalapeno-popper-pizza/#wprm-recipe-52575-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
